# IDE / agent tooling
.vscode/
.windsurf/
# Claude Code writes a local settings file (permission allowlists, machine
# state) wherever it is run from. Untracked but unignored, it sat one
# `git add -A` away from a public repo — and nested copies appear under any
# subdirectory a session was started in.
**/.claude/

# Local-only operational docs — the Tier 1 of "Disclosure tiering" in
# docs/ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md. Public repo: correlations (SSID->VLAN->PMF,
# console URLs and ports, MACs) are a recon shortcut, while the mechanisms and
# reasoning stay in the tracked docs. See docs/local/README.md. Never commit.
docs/local/

# System
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Python
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/

